---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out.stdout).unwrap()"
---
Fast CLI for Apple Notes, Reminders, and Calendar

Usage: jot [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  note  Capture and list notes [alias: n]
  task  Add and list reminders [aliases: t, todo]
  cal   Show calendar events [alias: c]
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
